name: mindustry-warden
displayName: "Warden"
author: yamakajump
main: mindustrywarden.WardenMod
description: "Host and sandbox tools: capture a sector, spawn units, fill the core, change game speed."
version: "0.1.0"
minGameVersion: 154
# Hidden from the multiplayer mod comparison on purpose. Warden touches nothing a remote
# server simulates, but a visible mod is enough for a server to refuse the player with
# "incompatible mods", which would punish carrying a tool that cannot affect that server.
hidden: true
